      "   -> Pasien Tumpang Tindih (Overlap) : 0 pasien\n",
      "   -> KESIMPULAN: [VALID & AMAN] 100% Bebas Kebocoran Data (Zero Leakage)!\n",
      "      Tidak ada satu pun foto dari pasien yang sama yang muncul di Train dan Test.\n",
      "\n",
      "===================== TABEL DISTRIBUSI HASIL SLICING ISIC 2024 =====================\n",
      "\n"
     ]
